      <description><![CDATA[<p>Tabs of pairs: each tab keeps its own two panes (folders, history, selection, scroll). ⌘T opens a new tab with the same pair, ⌘W closes it, ⌃Tab and ⌘1–9 switch. Drag tabs to reorder, double-click to rename. Tabs come back when you relaunch, and a tab whose folder is part of a running transfer shows its progress.</p>]]></description>
